    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on Julia\u2019s journey in this 2.5D eco-apocalyptic adventure where survival is more than just a struggle\u2014it\u2019s a discovery. Based on Alejandra Bruno\u2019s award-winning novel La Hija del Delta, The Swamp Daughter offers a rich narrative of identity, choices, and environmental collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301850/extras/7fab28cf78d8e724b461350a26905424.avif?t=1755191236\" data-has-big width=1560 height=496 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you guide Julia through a decaying, mysterious swamp, you\u2019ll unravel her hidden past while shaping her future. Every decision ripples through the game\u2019s branching story, leading to multiple endings that reflect your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dangerous, dreamlike landscape of the swamp is more than just a backdrop\u2014it\u2019s a living character in its own right. Explore, gather vital resources, and piece together the mystery of Julia\u2019s origins. With a blend of quick-time events, puzzles, and exploration, The Swamp Daughter immerses players in a world where every choice matters, and every step deepens the emotional, gripping tale of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Key Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Narrative: </strong>Make crucial decisions that shape the story and lead to multiple unique endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301850/extras/3b71b1e69a5f6aeeb458d9c81bc198c5.avif?t=1755191236\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Beautiful but Dangerous World: </strong>Explore a stunning yet decaying swamp filled with both beauty and peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301850/extras/72966ad4b9be91ec863d01cff88911d5.avif?t=1755191236\" width=1238 height=345 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Survival Mechanics:</strong> Face quick-time events, resource management, and puzzles that test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301850/extras/e59ee98ebadc914b89fadd3e615ab7d6.avif?t=1755191236\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling:</strong> Discover the ruins of civilization and uncover clues to Julia\u2019s identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301850/extras/5b392955c8ba0c4232938097e10297fd.avif?t=1755191236\" width=1238 height=345 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Farming and Construction Mini-Games: </strong>Develop skills to survive while respecting the fragile ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301850/extras/3de8276c5fd9880ae2f046023e819deb.avif?t=1755191236\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Cinematics</strong>: Experience cinematic storytelling with stunning art and camera mapping that bring the world to life.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301850/extras/2fc4c6d9933cad17ed5b8140abe558db.avif?t=1755191236\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on Julia\u2019s journey in this 2.5D eco-apocalyptic adventure where survival is more than just a struggle\u2014it\u2019s a discovery. Based on Alejandra Bruno\u2019s award-winning novel La Hija del Delta, The Swamp Daughter offers a rich narrative of identity, choices, and environmental collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301850/extras/7fab28cf78d8e724b461350a26905424.avif?t=1755191236\" data-has-big width=1560 height=496 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you guide Julia through a decaying, mysterious swamp, you\u2019ll unravel her hidden past while shaping her future. Every decision ripples through the game\u2019s branching story, leading to multiple endings that reflect your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dangerous, dreamlike landscape of the swamp is more than just a backdrop\u2014it\u2019s a living character in its own right. Explore, gather vital resources, and piece together the mystery of Julia\u2019s origins. With a blend of quick-time events, puzzles, and exploration, The Swamp Daughter immerses players in a world where every choice matters, and every step deepens the emotional, gripping tale of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Key Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Narrative: </strong>Make crucial decisions that shape the story and lead to multiple unique endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301850/extras/3b71b1e69a5f6aeeb458d9c81bc198c5.avif?t=1755191236\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Beautiful but Dangerous World: </strong>Explore a stunning yet decaying swamp filled with both beauty and peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301850/extras/72966ad4b9be91ec863d01cff88911d5.avif?t=1755191236\" width=1238 height=345 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Survival Mechanics:</strong> Face quick-time events, resource management, and puzzles that test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301850/extras/e59ee98ebadc914b89fadd3e615ab7d6.avif?t=1755191236\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling:</strong> Discover the ruins of civilization and uncover clues to Julia\u2019s identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301850/extras/5b392955c8ba0c4232938097e10297fd.avif?t=1755191236\" width=1238 height=345 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Farming and Construction Mini-Games: </strong>Develop skills to survive while respecting the fragile ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301850/extras/3de8276c5fd9880ae2f046023e819deb.avif?t=1755191236\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Cinematics</strong>: Experience cinematic storytelling with stunning art and camera mapping that bring the world to life.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301850/extras/2fc4c6d9933cad17ed5b8140abe558db.avif?t=1755191236\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul>",
